# beep and play: every note measured by the kernel's probe (TEST_SOUND),
# the tune's two rests silent.
program: shell
define: TEST_SOUND
keys: beep\nplay\n
timeout: 60
---
rx286, test build
rx286 shell: type help for the commands
A:\>beep
probe: the speaker sounds at the frequency asked
probe: silent
A:\>play
probe: the speaker sounds at the frequency asked
probe: silent
probe: the speaker sounds at the frequency asked
probe: silent
